Package: usefulfunctions
Title: Reusable Helpers for Single-Cell, Bulk RNA-Seq and Cancer
        Genomics
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dillon", "Corvino", , "dilloncorvino@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0683-1369"))
Description: A curated collection of helper functions and thin wrappers that Dillon
    Corvino uses across immunology and cancer-genomics analyses. It bundles utilities
    for colour handling, differential-expression volcano plots, heatmaps and
    dendrograms, gene-identifier conversion, gene-set / Gene Ontology enrichment,
    TCGA survival analysis, and single-cell (Seurat) helpers such as UMAP
    hyper-parameter optimisation and gene-gene correlation. Heavy Bioconductor
    dependencies are optional (Suggests) so the package installs quickly; each
    function checks for the packages it needs at call time.
